        "name": "Persistent branches",
        "score": 9,
        "rationale": "The script skips every `persistent/*` branch through KEEP_PATTERNS, leaves all rulesets untouched, and the reply explains that the nightly report writes to `persistent/build-report`, which never has a PR and is deletion-protected by the `persistent` ruleset, though it could state more directly that the team dashboard depends on it."
