      {
        "name": "Working result",
        "score": 9,
        "rationale": "The workflow runs weekly by cron, keeps any branch used as head or base of an open PR, never deletes the default branch, protected branches or recently committed branches, and limits permissions to contents: write and pull-requests: read; it was only tested with fake commands, not live."
      },
      {
        "name": "Report",
